+        并发重复共享由唯一约束兜底：IntegrityError 后回滚回查既有行。返回
+        (share, grantee username, grantee display_name) 供 router 组 DTO。
+        """
+        from app.modules.auth.model import User
+
+        provider = await self.get(provider_id, owner_id)
+        target = (
